notes.content:
1. Fixed issues causing lag in certain scenes;

2. Removed self-damage from grenades dropped by grenade drones;

3. Fixed duplicate calculation issues in some Steam statistics;

4. Fixed the issue where drones didn't fall after being shot;

5. Fixed the issue where soldiers continued shooting after destroying a drone;

6. Fixed the issue where soldier status didn't display after restarting when the signalman died.
